        "collapsible_tab_bdInfo1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "display_on_card": true,
            "icon": "star",
            "heading": "What’s Inside",
            "uppercase_text": false,
            "content": "<p>A tear-out mission book built for real dads and their kids.</p><p>Inside, you’ll find funny, practical challenges designed to turn ordinary moments into memorable dad–kid adventures. Complete missions, collect stickers, fill the achievement poster and work your way towards the ultimate title: <strong>Best Dad in the World</strong>.</p><p>No perfect parenting required. Just questionable decisions, real bonding and stories worth remembering.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_bdInfo2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "display_on_card": true,
            "icon": "box",
            "heading": "Size & What’s Included",
            "uppercase_text": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>Book dimensions</strong></p><p>6.3 × 9 × 0.6 in (16 × 22.8 × 1.5 cm)<br/><br/>Weight: 1.0 lb (460 g)</p><p><strong>Included in the package</strong></p><p>The tear-out mission book<br/><br/>One Dad Achievement Poster<br/><br/>One themed sticker pack<br/><br/>One custom sticker envelope</p><p>Everything needed to start completing missions and earning Dad Supremacy immediately.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_bdInfo3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "display_on_card": true,
            "icon": "truck",
            "heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "uppercase_text": false,
            "content": "<p>Orders are normally shipped on the next business day and delivered within approximately <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</p><p>We offer a <strong>30-day return period</strong> on full-price items. To qualify for a return, the book must remain unused, unopened and in its original plastic wrapping. No pages may be removed, no stickers used, and the poster must be unused and unmarked.</p><p>Return shipping costs are covered by the customer. Sale items, discounted products, gift cards and personalized items cannot be returned.</p><p>To request a return or report a damaged or incorrect order, contact <strong>info@bestdadbook.com</strong> before sending anything back. Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method after the returned item has been received and inspected.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
